    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale the \"professional support\" thing isn't helping. i've talked to people, i've tried the \"coping\" stuff, but the math just doesn't add up. the debt is growing, the burnout is permanent, and i feel like a ghost just going through the motions. it's like i'm stuck in a room with no doors and everyone is just watching me struggle through the window. it just feels fundamentally broken. like there is no version of my life where this actually gets better.",
